.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rollback 1  "rollback " 
.SH NAME
rollback \- Roll a snippet back: publish an old version\*(Aqs content as a NEW version (history is never rewritten)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrollback\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> <\fIVERSION\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Roll a snippet back: publish an old version\*(Aqs content as a NEW version (history is never rewritten)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
Snippet reference: name or owner/name (your own)
.TP
<\fIVERSION\fR>
The version whose content to restore
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg rollback ubuntu\-setup 2
